@ECOWARRIORSS @HELLANBIGLOVE 🚨 ‘Palm oil / Palm Olein / Vegetable Oil’ are used in countless products, esp. in Asia. 💔

‘Sunflower oil, or olive oil’ at %, the rest is palm olein, etc.🌻 Olive oil may not be pure @ x grade. Beware. Check Source. ⚠️🫒

Coconut oil, &amp; sesame oil are distinct. 🥥🏝️☮️

@TiredActor add turmeric, chili powder, salt to a small spoon or two of heated oil in a pan...mix it up with chopped bread : seasoned bread (vagharela pav in gujarati)

made it recently...simple, easy, delicious
